SUMMARY:Mindful Masculinity - Exploring Conscious Brotherhood
DESCRIPTION:We Meet Bi-Weekly\, Every Other Wednesday · 7:00 – 8:30 PM · $15 \nThrough open dialogue\, mindfulness\, and other calming practices\, we quiet the mind\, open the heart\, and deepen our connection to ourselves and each other.  The circle is open to all male identifying individuals. \nMeetings are hosted by Leo A. Sante – mindfulness coach\, teacher\, and dad. \nWe start by sharing our wins and challenges\, honoring each voice without judgment or advice. From there\, we move into practices that help us release stress\, shift perspective\, and bring awareness and resilience into our lives. \nEach week centers on a different theme to help guide us – trust\, accomplishment\, family\, rest\, intimacy\, presence – as we discover new ways to move through the world as mindful men. \nCome as you are. Leave more grounded\, connected\, and inspired. \nConnect with Leo:\nInstagram: @holdingpresence\nOnline: HoldingPresence.com\nEmail: pe***********@***il.com
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/mindful-masculinity-exploring-conscious-brotherhood-2/
LOCATION:the Space\, 356 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, New Jersey\, 07042
CATEGORIES:Meditation,Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-03-at-6.27.42-PM.png
END:VEVENT
